BEGIN ~KKAmana~
BEGIN ~KKCelin~
BEGIN ~KKDelia~
BEGIN ~KKTress~
BEGIN ~KKShael~

CHAIN IF WEIGHT #-1 ~Global("KKMissingWarriors","GLOBAL",6)~ THEN ~KKAmana~ Barbs02
~I might have known you would show up. You always were Osarena's favorite.~  DO ~SetGlobal("KKMissingWarriors","GLOBAL",7)~
== ~KKNavJ~ ~You knew I would eventually find you, Amana.~
== ~KKCelin~ ~Navarra?~
== ~KKDelia~ ~What are you doing here?~
== ~KKNavJ~ ~Tressa, Shaelah... Why have you not completed your mission and retrieved the sword?~
== ~KKTress~ ~We were about to do just that. Why have you come?~
== ~KKNavJ~ ~Chieftain Osarena thought you both might have been killed and sent me to look for you and finish your mission.~
== ~KKShael~ ~There is no point in lying to her, Tressa. We have decided to join Amana, we like it here and agree with her on this.~
== ~KKNavJ~ ~So you decided to tell me to come here because you were leading me into a trap.~
== ~KKShael~ ~You would have kept looking until you found us. We decided it was easier to just get it over with, so we can get on with our lives.~
== ~KKCelin~ ~Osarena never needs to know you found us, Navarra. Tressa and the others have already seen the truth to what we say, hear us out.~
== ~KKNavJ~ ~Speak but it will make no difference! She won't stop sending warriors after you until you return the sword.~
== ~KKDelia~ ~Osarena is being unreasonable, we have the right to move from that frigid wasteland! We would all thrive better here and she knows it.~
== ~KKAmana~ ~If she won't do it, then we will. We will start a new life here, with me as the new Chieftain. Join us, Navarra, this is paradise compared to Narfell!~
== ~KKNavJ~ ~You do not care where we all live, you only wish to steal my birthright! I will not allow it, Amana!~
== ~KKAmana~ ~In that, you are wrong. I am only taking what should have been mine in the first place! And I would rather be here than freezing to death and fighting to survive.~
== ~KKNavJ~ ~This is madness! You all wish to become outcasts, so be it. Do as you wish, live where you wish but the sword is going back to Narfell.~
= ~To Chieftain Osarena, it's rightful owner. Give it to me now!~
== ~KKAmana~ ~You may be good, but your no match for all of us and you know it.~
== ~KKNavJ~ ~As you can see, I am not alone!~ EXIT